Bug: 544914962
Bug: 562404165
Bug: 563119166
Change-Id: I01d566ca3d1c9492f8447c0ec1f3ef80536d45a0
Signed-off-by: zhangbo56 <zhangbo56@xiaomi.com>


Backport: retain only the matching Xiaomi symbol-list additions; regenerate ABI reference metadata from the target build.
